{"_doc":"Per letter id (order P, I…VIII, E): words = up to 8 lemma keys of lexicon_ko.json for the \"today's words\" card, chosen from that letter's Korean line by chapter band (P/I–II: A1–A2, III–V: B1, VI–VIII/E: B2–C1; widened by one band only when needed), never repeating a lemma of an earlier letter; nouns, verbs, adjectives, adverbs only — no names, function words, homograph entries (one-syllable words are allowed). spots = [] (plate spots keep their words for this language). phrases = 1–2 expressions copied verbatim from the Korean line: {t: text, m: message index, ko, en, note_ko, note_en} — en = English translation, ko = plain-Korean paraphrase.","lang":"ko","letters":{"p1":{"words":["아프다","때","집","방","정원","풀","다시","보다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"풀 한 포기까지","m":0,"ko":"풀 한 포기도 빼놓지 않고","en":"down to every blade of grass","note_ko":"~까지: 작은 것 하나까지 빠짐없이 (강조).","note_en":"-까지 here stresses \"even down to the smallest thing\"."}]},"p2":{"words":["색","감자","먹다","사람","덜","어둡다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"〈감자 먹는 사람들〉보다 덜 어두워","m":0,"ko":"감자 먹는 사람들보다 밝아","en":"less dark than The Potato Eaters","note_ko":"A보다 덜 + 형용사: 비교 (덜 = less).","note_en":"A보다 덜 + adjective = \"less … than A\"."}]},"p3":{"words":["오다","버리다","화내다","원하다","더","일찍"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"화내지 마","m":0,"ko":"화를 내지 말아 줘","en":"don't be cross","note_ko":"-지 마: 친구 사이의 부정 명령 ('~하지 마').","note_en":"-지 마 is the casual \"don't\"."},{"t":"정오부터","m":0,"ko":"낮 12시부터","en":"from noon","note_ko":"-부터: 시작 시점 ('~부터').","note_en":"-부터 marks a starting point (from)."}]},"p4":{"words":["불다","고장","정말","아름답다","그림","그리다","좋다"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"미스트랄만 덜 불면","m":0,"ko":"바람만 약하면","en":"if only the mistral blew less","note_ko":"-만 … -면: '~만 하면' 조건 강조.","note_en":"-만 … -면 = \"if only …\"."}]},"c1-l1":{"words":["사랑하다","길","처음","생각하다","말하다","두다","지금","하늘"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"너를 많이 생각했어","m":0,"ko":"네 생각을 많이 했어","en":"I thought about you a lot","note_ko":"~를 생각하다: 사람을 생각하다.","note_en":"-를 생각하다 = to thin